@spaceUrl = http://localhost:3001
@membershipUrl = http://localhost:3002
@bookingUrl = http://localhost:3004

### 1. Crear una sede (Space)
# @name sede
POST {{spaceUrl}}/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sede Norte", "city": "Montería", "address": "Carrera 6 #60-10" }

### 2. Crear una sala (Space)
# @name sala
POST {{spaceUrl}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "locationId": "{{sede.response.body.id}}", "name": "Sala Sinú", "capacity": 6 }

### 3. Crear un puesto (Space)
# @name puesto
POST {{spaceUrl}}/desks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "locationId": "{{sede.response.body.id}}", "code": "N-01" }

### 4. Crear un miembro (Membership)
# @name miembro
POST {{membershipUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Carlos Gómez", "email": "carlos-prod@example.com" }

### 5. Crear un plan que solo incluye puestos (Membership)
# @name plan
POST {{membershipUrl}}/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Solo puestos Prod", "price": 250000, "resourceAccess": ["DESK"] }

### 6. Suscribir al miembro (Membership)
POST {{membershipUrl}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": "{{miembro.response.body.id}}", "planId": "{{plan.response.body.id}}" }

### 7. Reservar el puesto: CONFIRMED, sin cargo (incluido en el plan)
# @name reservaPuesto
POST {{bookingUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": "{{miembro.response.body.id}}",
  "resourceId": "{{puesto.response.body.id}}",
  "resourceType": "DESK",
  "startTime": "2026-11-25T14:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-11-25T17:00:00.000Z"
}

### 8. Reservar la sala: PENDING_PAYMENT con cargo adicional (fuera del plan)
POST {{bookingUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": "{{miembro.response.body.id}}",
  "resourceId": "{{sala.response.body.id}}",
  "resourceType": "ROOM",
  "startTime": "2026-11-25T15:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-11-25T17:00:00.000Z"
}

### 9. Reservar el puesto en un horario que se cruza: debe fallar con 409
POST {{bookingUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": "{{miembro.response.body.id}}",
  "resourceId": "{{puesto.response.body.id}}",
  "resourceType": "DESK",
  "startTime": "2026-11-25T16:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-11-25T18:00:00.000Z"
}

### 10. Ver la disponibilidad del puesto
GET {{bookingUrl}}/bookings/availability?resourceId={{puesto.response.body.id}}&from=2026-11-25T00:00:00.000Z&to=2026-11-26T00:00:00.000Z

### 11. Cancelar la reserva del puesto (publica booking.cancelled)
PATCH {{bookingUrl}}/bookings/{{reservaPuesto.response.body.id}}/cancel

### 12. Reservar otra vez el horario que antes chocaba: ahora debe funcionar
POST {{bookingUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": "{{miembro.response.body.id}}",
  "resourceId": "{{puesto.response.body.id}}",
  "resourceType": "DESK",
  "startTime": "2026-11-25T16:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-11-25T18:00:00.000Z"
}